% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% kernel.clausal -- the SHARED FLOOR for sg/companies/csp_registration (eligibility family).
% DAG root of the determination-slices layout. It holds ONLY the
% PREDICATES that two or more files CALL -- possibly none, which is why
% the export list below starts empty.
%
% Result term for the single determination slice (csp_registration):
%   csp(Decision, ServiceTypes, Missing, NomineeDuty, Citations)
% where:
%   Decision: no_corporate_service | not_carrying_on_business_in_singapore
%             | registered | registration_required | indeterminate
%   ServiceTypes: list of engaged type atoms in limb order:
%             [formation, director_secretary, address, nominee_shareholder,
%              designated_accounting, acra_transaction]
%   Missing: list of engaged types NOT covered by registration (same order)
%   NomineeDuty: complied | breached | not_applicable | n_a
%   Citations: list of bare citation atoms in rule-stated order
%
% Source: Corporate Service Providers Act 2024 (Act 22 of 2024),
%         s 2(1), s 7(1), s 7(2), s 16(1), s 16(2).
% =====================================================================

:- module(kernel, []).

:- end_module(kernel).
